13
00:01:04.953 --> 00:01:10.956
Like. some shantytown in South
Asia. or the frozen north of Iceland.

14
00:01:10.959 --> 00:01:14.064
or a burning desert in Africa.

15
00:01:14.712 --> 00:01:16.002
But that's it.

16
00:01:16.005 --> 00:01:20.549
We are exactly who we are.
in this moment. in this place.

17
00:01:20.551 --> 00:01:22.221
and I think that matters.

18
00:01:23.013 --> 00:01:26.474
Because without you. without
me. everything is different.

19
00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:30.142
I don't know if anything
would be different without me.

20
00:01:30.145 --> 00:01:31.355
I would be different.

21
