Okay. if I do something. it affects you.

22
00:01:34.233 --> 00:01:38.026
Makes you do something that
affects. I don't know. Alex Standall.

23
00:01:38.027 --> 00:01:41.070
who affects Jessica Davis.

24
00:01:41.073 --> 00:01:46.954
Who affects Justin Foley. then
Zach Dempsey. then Mrs. Bradley.

25
00:01:46.957 --> 00:01:50.704
- and then Tony Padilla...
- And on and on.

26
00:01:50.706 --> 00:01:52.915
It's huge if you think about it.

27
00:01:52.918 --> 00:01:54.920
It's an infinite universe.

28
00:01:56.259 --> 00:01:57.380
Infinity.

29
00:01:58.215 --> 00:02:00.173
It's funny we have a
word for that concept.

30
00:02:00.174 --> 00:02:02.635
but there's no way we can understand it.

31
00:02:03.719 --> 00:02:07.974
- Maybe... love?
- Love?

32
00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:12.104
Maybe love is how you
understand infinity.

33
00:02:13.437 --> 00:02:16.483
When your love has no limit.
When it goes on forever.

34
00:02:17.776 --> 00:02:20.194
Maybe that feels like infinity.

35
00:02:21.405 --> 00:02:23.782
Yeah. Maybe.

36
