72
00:04:42.628 --> 00:04:44.587
Good. We'll have fun.

73
00:04:44.588 --> 00:04:46.673
All right. Get yourself
up. do your stretches.

74
00:04:46.674 --> 00:04:49.928
And I have a new hemp milk
to try. It's delicious.

75
00:05:02.356 --> 00:05:04.231
