Baker. and I had to go...

81
00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:18.539
No excuses needed.

82
00:05:20.708 --> 00:05:23.585
Look. I don't wanna tie you down.

83
00:05:23.587 --> 00:05:25.671
And I don't want you to
think you owe me anything.

84
00:05:28.049 --> 00:05:32.011
But I like you. A lot. I think.

85
00:05:43.314 --> 00:05:44.856
- I'm done early tonight.
- Hmm.

86
00:05:44.857 --> 00:05:46.193
No self-defense class.

87
00:05:48.611 --> 00:05:52.991
- That's quite a group you got there.
