the PTSD from the assault.

94
00:06:08.933 --> 00:06:10.342
Seems pretty haunted by it.

95
00:06:11.347 --> 00:06:12.426
Jesus.

96
00:06:15.222 --> 00:06:18.388
- Does he remember much?
- Haven't spoken to him about it.

97
00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:21.477
- There's lots of stories in that class.
- I bet.

98
00:06:22.604 --> 00:06:25.063
Aren't we going the wrong
way for your first period?

99
00:06:25.065 --> 00:06:27.316
Uh. I thought we'd
take the long way today.

100
00:06:28.859 --> 00:06:30.861
