101
00:06:31.862 --> 00:06:36.784
And why is he smiling like that? What?

102
00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:42.664
- Wait. is it your birthday?
- Whoo!

103
00:06:42.666 --> 00:06:43.998
- What?
- What?

104
00:06:46.001 --> 00:06:49.294
- You guys got a banner made?
- It was a group project.

105
00:06:49.296 --> 00:06:53.840
I made the design. Clay ordered
it online. and Zach put it up.

106
00:06:53.842 --> 00:06:55.260
Wow. that's...

107
00:06:57.179 --> 00:06:59.888
...that's really. really nice. you guys.

108
00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.183
Aw.

109
00:07:02.393 --> 00:07:04.393
Happy birthday. buddy.

110
00:07:04.395 --> 00:07:06.813
Oh. sweet banner.

111
00:07:06.815 --> 00:07:08.231
Is your mom bringing cupcakes?

112
00:07:08.232 --> 00:07:10.357
I hope she brings enough
for the whole class.

113
00:07:10.359 --> 00:07:12.359
Maybe you'll get a new
cane this year too. huh?

114
00:07:12.361 --> 00:07:14.445
Yeah.

115
00:07:14.446 --> 00:07:15.878
And some new friends.

116
00:07:17.409 --> 00:07:18.702
Fuck you!

117
00:07:19.452 --> 00:07:21.003
You fucking rapist!

118
00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:33.715
Dude. shit like that
doesn't do anybody any good.

119
00:07:33.717 --> 00:07:35.909
Yeah? Well. it felt good to me.

120
00:07:35.912 --> 00:07:37.885
Maybe if you'd stop
defending him all the time.

121
00:07:37.888 --> 00:07:40.597
- When have I ever defended him?
- Every day.

122
00:07:40.599 --> 00:07:43.265
Every day you hang around him
and play baseball with him.

123
00:07:43.267 --> 00:07:44.851
you choose his side.

124
00:07:44.852 --> 00:07:45.936
Jess. tell him.

125
00:07:47.647 --> 00:07:49.106
Why would you do that?

126
00:07:50.191 --> 00:07:52.443
Shit. I'm so sorry.

127
00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:54.987
- I mean...
- Jess.

128
00:07:56.128 --> 00:07:57.323
Don't.

129
00:08:11.755 --> 00:08:14.130
Come on. didn't you see the red light?

130
00:08:14.131 --> 00:08:15.342
- It means you're not...
- Hey.

131
00:08:16.612 --> 00:08:17.760
Uh. hi.

132
00:08:18.801 --> 00:08:22.304
- Sorry.
- No. uh. you're... No big deal.

133
00:08:22.306 --> 00:08:24.431
I know what the red light means.

134
00:08:24.433 --> 00:08:26.645
So. um. last night was really fun.

135
00:08:27.604 --> 00:08:29.811
We should. maybe. do it again sometime.

136
00:08:29.813 --> 00:08:32.606
We should clean vomit
off your brother's boots?

137
00:08:32.608 --> 00:08:35.985
We should hang out.
Maybe not in the bathroom.

138
00:08:35.986 --> 00:08:38.529
So. hang out in your yard?

139
00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:43.952
Or another building. Restaurant.
Movie theater. perhaps?

140
00:08:43.953 --> 00:08:45.829
- Do you mean. like a...
- I mean. like a date.

141
00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:50.875
It's an early stage in the
mating ritual of homo sapiens.

142
00:08:50.876 --> 00:08:52.459
We agree to go somewhere together.

143
00:08:52.462 --> 00:08:54.044
I obsess over what to wear

144
00:08:54.047 --> 00:08:58.131
and then you obsess over if you
should pay or if we're splitting it.

145
00:08:58.134 --> 00:09:01.635
We show up. it either goes
great or it goes terrible.

146
00:09:01.637 --> 00:09:05.682
and then we decide if we wanna
put ourselves through it again.

147
00:09:05.683 --> 00:09:07.683
What sadistic person
invented this ritual?

148
00:09:09.707 --> 00:09:10.938
Every person.

149
00:09:13.107 --> 00:09:15.150
- So. you wanna?
- Um...

150
00:09:16.611 --> 00:09:19.280
Yes. I... I really do.

151
00:09:20.198 --> 00:09:22.656
She was faithful.

152
00:09:22.659 --> 00:09:25.451
She was kind to me and cared
about what happened to me.

153
00:09:25.453 --> 00:09:28.788
She never gossiped. or
told lies about people.

154
00:09:28.789 --> 00:09:31.624
And what sorts of things
did you do together?

155
00:09:31.626 --> 00:09:35.419
We had some classes together.
we ate lunch together sometimes.

156
00:09:35.422 --> 00:09:37.672
and we worked together at the Crestmont.

157
00:09:37.674 --> 00:09:39.674
And we talked. a lot.

158
00:09:39.675 --> 00:09:42.427
- What did you talk about?
- We talked about...

159
00:09:42.429 --> 00:09:47.222
about books and shows
and songs and eclipses

160
00:09:47.225 --> 00:09:52.270
and zombies and bike helmets and...

161
00:09:52.271 --> 00:09:56.356
and I guess our... our hopes and dreams.

162
00:09:56.358 --> 00:09:57.519
Helmet.

163
00:10:00.321 --> 00:10:02.490
Helmet. Helmet.

164
00:10:03.574 --> 00:10:06.327
If you don't help build this tower.
you don't get to knock it down.

165
00:10:08.163 --> 00:10:09.762
I... I just need to finish this chapter.

166
00:10:10.414 --> 00:10:13.875
Do you really have homework?
School's over in. like. two days.

167
00:10:13.876 --> 00:10:16.170
All we do in my classes
is watch Stand and Deliver.

168
00:10:19.674 --> 00:10:22.901
I wanna get the summer
reading done before I. um.

169
00:10:22.905 --> 00:10:25.468
leave for my grandparents'

170
00:10:25.472 --> 00:10:26.922
for the summer.

171
00:10:26.924 --> 00:10:28.098
Wait. what?

172
00:10:29.461 --> 00:10:32.059
My parents think it's
good for a "growing boy"

173
00:10:32.062 --> 00:10:34.478
