bullying at Liberty High.

219
00:13:05.756 --> 00:13:08.669
But isn't it true that you are
also a part of that culture?

220
00:13:08.672 --> 00:13:09.925
No. I don't think I am.

221
00:13:09.928 --> 00:13:13.511
Isn't it true that you took pictures
of Tyler Down through his window

222
00:13:13.514 --> 00:13:16.640
that you then circulated around
the school via social media?

223
00:13:16.643 --> 00:13:18.643
- Yes. but...
- Objection. Your Honor.

224
00:13:18.645 --> 00:13:20.102
Beyond the scope of the direct.

225
00:13:20.103 --> 00:13:23.547
Your Honor. he's already testified
to the nature of bullying at Liberty.

226
00:13:23.549 --> 00:13:24.981
I'll allow it.

227
00:13:24.983 --> 00:13:27.693
Clay. isn't it true that you
were suspended from school

228
00:13:27.694 --> 00:13:29.111
for possession of marijuana?

229
00:13:29.112 --> 00:13:31.488
- It wasn't mine. I was set up.
- I see.

230
00:13:31.491 --> 00:13:34.158
And at any point subsequent
to that suspension.

231
00:13:34.159 --> 00:13:36.211
did you attempt to buy more marijuana?

232
00:13:36.213 --> 00:13:39.593
- Yes. but I was...
- And isn't it true that your vandalism

233
00:13:39.597 --> 00:13:42.625
caused thousands of dollars of
damage to Zach Dempsey's car?

234
00:13:42.626 --> 00:13:46.127
I was angry at him. I...
I paid for the damage.

235
00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:48.463
What did you do when you were
angry at Courtney Crimsen?

236
00:13:48.466 --> 00:13:50.216
I just took her to Hannah's grave.

237
00:13:50.217 --> 00:13:51.776
And isn't it true that you accused her

238
00:13:51.778 --> 00:13:53.718
of being responsible for Hannah's death?

239
00:13:53.721 --> 00:13:56.889
She is responsible. All of
those kids are responsible.

240
00:13:56.890 --> 00:14:00.395
Are you responsible. Clay? Are
you responsible for Hannah's death?

241
00:14:03.648 --> 00:14:06.856
Yes. I am. I let her down.

242
00:14:06.858 --> 00:14:10.443
But there are kids who did a lot
worse. kids who you let skate.

243
00:14:10.446 --> 00:14:12.314
who did things you
won't even talk about.

244
00:14:12.318 --> 00:14:13.530
And adults at Liberty don't...

245
00:14:13.533 --> 00:14:15.616
Request to strike
that as non-responsive.

246
00:14:15.617 --> 00:14:18.785
So ordered. The jury
will ignore that answer.

