750
00:45:55.892 --> 00:45:58.600
- Trying to help a friend in need.
- Our son is in need.

751
00:45:58.602 --> 00:46:00.935
Yes. Matt. I'm aware.

752
00:46:00.937 --> 00:46:04.314
I can't stop thinking about
it. Skye. They destroyed me.

753
00:46:04.316 --> 00:46:06.066
Ask me why she was depressed.

754
00:46:06.068 --> 00:46:08.319
Why she was destroyed.
Ask me who did that to her.

755
00:46:08.321 --> 00:46:10.470
- No further questions.
- Jury will disregard.

756
00:46:10.473 --> 00:46:11.598
Witness. stand down.

757
00:46:12.866 --> 00:46:14.160
But did I deserve it?

758
00:46:16.662 --> 00:46:18.622
Who ordered the cinnamon rolls?

759
00:46:19.915 --> 00:46:22.334
If I put that in my mouth.
I will literally puke.

760
00:46:23.169 --> 00:46:26.294
- Are we. like. all in bad moods?
- I am.

761
00:46:26.296 --> 00:46:29.091
I just don't even have
the energy to care.

762
00:46:30.008 --> 00:46:33.968
No. we're just coming down. It's normal.

763
00:46:33.970 --> 00:46:36.557
- What's the point. right?
- Yeah. exactly.

764
00:46:37.807 --> 00:46:40.102
No. but. like. really.
what's the point of anything?

765
00:46:41.144 --> 00:46:42.647
That's just the Molly talking.

766
00:46:44.857 --> 00:46:46.734
Her name's Hannah.

767
00:46:50.446 --> 00:46:52.823
You've gotta handle the lows
if you wanna chase the highs.

768
00:46:54.075 --> 00:46:57.202
Come on. drink some water. Don't
let your mind go to that dark place.

769
00:46:59.664 --> 00:47:03.999
Do you ever think. "I can't do
it anymore"? Like. "I wanna die"?

770
00:47:04.001 --> 00:47:06.711
Yep. Every single minute.

771
00:47:12.593 --> 00:47:14.011
Like everything's black?

772
00:47:15.888 --> 00:47:19.642
Guys. get through this.
Okay? Get through this moment.

773
00:47:21.560 --> 00:47:22.937
And it'll all be clear.

774
00:47:30.111 --> 00:47:32.153
Skye. she said it and I heard it.

775
00:47:33.488 --> 00:47:36.616
I couldn't help her then.
and I couldn't help her today.

776
00:47:39.202 --> 00:47:41.122
I've got to be able to
do something to help.

777
00:47:44.082 --> 00:47:46.459
People need to know the whole story.

778
00:48:02.852 --> 00:48:03.977
Hey.

779
00:48:04.729 --> 00:48:07.689
That's great. That's just perfect.

780
00:48:11.194 --> 00:48:12.522
Clay. honey.

781
00:48:17.198 --> 00:48:20.243
Come on. lover. Give me a
little. I had a shitty day.

782
00:48:21.412 --> 00:48:25.665
Yeah. I know. I heard Alex
had one of his outbursts.

783
00:48:26.459 --> 00:48:27.834
Well. the kid's sick.

784
00:48:28.877 --> 00:48:31.296
I feel bad for him.
Now forget about that.

785
00:48:35.091 --> 00:48:37.341
Babe. I thought we were
watching a movie tonight.

786
00:48:37.343 --> 00:48:39.720
- I've seen it.
- But you chose it.

787
00:48:39.722 --> 00:48:42.057
Yeah. so I don't have
to pay close attention.

788
00:48:42.850 --> 00:48:44.640
I'd rather pay attention to you.

789
00:48:52.568 --> 00:48:55.234
- Ow. Careful.
- Yeah.

790
00:48:58.073 --> 00:48:59.450
Is that better?

791
00:49:09.959 --> 00:49:15.381
- Babe. what is up with you tonight?
- Just the usual. Being into you.

792
00:49:20.261 --> 00:49:23.222
Babe. what... what about the movie?

793
00:49:23.223 --> 00:49:24.640
Fuck the movie.

794
00:49:30.064 --> 00:49:31.147
Look...

795
00:49:33.274 --> 00:49:34.568
You're good. yeah?

796
00:49:35.653 --> 00:49:37.321
- Yeah.
- And you want to. right?

797
00:49:38.740 --> 00:49:39.968
Right.

798
00:50:45.388 --> 00:50:47.473
Clay?

799
00:50:47.475 --> 00:50:50.263
You can keep up the silent
treatment as long as you have to.

800
00:50:50.267 --> 00:50:51.767
I understand.

801
00:50:51.769 --> 00:50:54.770
But Justin will need
your support tomorrow.

802
00:50:54.772 --> 00:50:56.566
And on Monday. okay?

803
00:51:02.656 --> 00:51:05.198
You're reading the comments.

804
00:51:05.200 --> 00:51:07.700
Don't ever read the comments.

805
00:51:07.702 --> 00:51:10.077
The shit that people say.

806
00:51:10.080 --> 00:51:11.832
about you. about me.

807
00:51:12.582 --> 00:51:14.167
They don't know the whole story.

808
00:51:19.339 --> 00:51:21.714
- Don't do this.
- I'm doing it for you.

809
00:51:21.716 --> 00:51:24.176
- I'm trying to make things right.
- You know it won't.

810
00:51:24.178 --> 00:51:26.220
What else can I do?

811
00:51:26.222 --> 00:51:29.189
You can help Jessica and Justin.
You can figure out those pictures.

812
00:51:29.193 --> 00:51:30.741
I don't care about the fucking pictures.

813
00:51:30.743 --> 00:51:33.142
I care about the
truth. I care about you.

814
00:51:33.144 --> 00:51:35.269
Then don't do it. You
know I don't want you to.

815
00:51:35.272 --> 00:51:37.323
Well. maybe you don't get a say anymore.

816
00:51:37.325 --> 00:51:40.107
People did terrible things to you
and they're getting away with it.

817
00:51:40.109 --> 00:51:43.736
- You left those tapes for a reason.
- What reason?

818
00:51:43.738 --> 00:51:47.073
To make people face what
they did and admit it

819
00:51:47.075 --> 00:51:49.327
and understand how fucked up it was.

820
00:51:50.120 --> 00:51:51.912
Do you think I wanted revenge?

821
00:51:51.914 --> 00:51:55.457
I don't know what you wanted.
because you left a huge fucking mess.

822
00:51:55.459 --> 00:51:57.584
I'm the only one interested
in cleaning it up.

823
00:51:57.586 --> 00:51:59.171
It wasn't revenge.

824
00:52:00.339 --> 00:52:02.548
I had to tell my own story.

825
00:52:04.260 --> 00:52:05.818
I wanted people to know what happened

826
00:52:05.819 --> 00:52:08.086
so maybe it wouldn't happen again.

827
00:52:08.089 --> 00:52:12.685
- Exactly. So everyone should hear it.
- No. not like this.

828
00:52:16.437 --> 00:52:17.731
You don't get to decide.

829
00:52:19.805 --> 00:52:20.977
You left.

830
00:52:32.113 --> 00:52:36.937
_

831
